  "description": "Life has never been easy for Monica Orphen. She spent her childhood at an orphanage before becoming a war nurse. During the war, she met a soldier named Sol, whose face she never forgot. Years later, by a stroke of luck, she runs into Sol again...except he says his name is Louis? But then the next time she runs into him he’s Garcia, then after that… Enrique? Monica isn’t sure what’s going on, but she isn’t going to give up until she finds out who this man really is! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
